{"headword":"רִמּוֹן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.23\">Je 52:23</a></sup> <strong>pomegranate (</strong>foreign word of doubtful origin, cf. Löw<sup>No. 310</sup> Hom<sup>A. u. A. 97 ff.</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">רִימּוֹנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּמָּנָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܽܘܡܳܢܳܐ</span>, Mand. <span dir=\"rtl\">רומאנא</span> Nö<sup>M. 123</sup>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رُمَّانٌ</span> (Aramaic loan-word, Frä <sup>142</sup>), Ethiopic ሮማን: <strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.2\">1 S 14:2</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמֹּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:26\" href=\"/Exodus.39.26\">Ex 39:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:26\" href=\"/Exodus.39.26\">26</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמֹּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.2\">Ct 8:2</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמּוֹנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.20\">1 K 7:20</a> +, etc.;—<em>pomegranate:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"tree <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.2\">1 S 14:2</a>, often + <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּפֶן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּאֵנָה</span>, etc., <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:5\" href=\"/Numbers.20.5\">Nu 20:5</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.8\">Dt 8:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:19\" href=\"/Haggai.2.19\">Hg 2:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:12\" href=\"/Joel.1.12\">Jo 1:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.13\">Ct 4:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.11\">6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.13\">7:13</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fruit <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:23\" href=\"/Numbers.13.23\">Nu 13:23</a> (JE; + <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָבִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּאֵנִים</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲסִי